.TH RPKI-PROVER 1 "" "rpki-prover @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rpki-prover \- RPKI relying party software
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rpki-prover
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B rpki-prover
validates the RPKI certificate tree and serves the results over an HTTP API,
a web UI, Prometheus metrics and the RTR protocol.
.PP
Run
.B rpki-prover --help
for the full list of options; there is no configuration file.  When run as the
packaged systemd service the options come from
.BR /etc/default/rpki-prover .
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /etc/default/rpki-prover
Command line options used by the systemd unit.
.TP
.B /var/lib/rpki-prover/
State directory of the service.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/lolepezy/rpki-prover
